OL,3,AStreeting denies 'kicking can down the
OL,4,Aroad' in defence spending row
OL,5,
OL,6,FDefence Secretary Wes Streeting has
OL,7,Fdenied "kicking the can down the road"
OL,8,Fover how much the UK spends on defence.
OL,10,FThe government has faced criticism for
OL,11,Fnot setting out a pathway at
OL,12,FWednesday's Budget to hit its target of
OL,13,Fspending 3% of GDP on defence by 2030.
OL,15,FStreeting is at odds with MPs on the
OL,16,FCommons defence committee over the
OL,17,Fissue.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
